# filesel.input — drive the Motif XmFileSelectionBox test using NEdit's own
# code shape (FileSB-level XmNcancelCallback + a nested XtAppProcessEvent loop).
#
# The dialog is a popup shell (XmCSHUFMask) parented to the app toplevel, so it
# becomes its own xdg_popup, exactly like NEdit's File -> Open dialog.  The
# popup has no client-side titlebar, so its coordinates are surface-relative.
#
# Geometry is printed by the test (tests/test_xm_filesel.c):
#   GEO:CANCEL  w=82 h=48 rel=175,411   -> centre 216,435

sleep 900
motion 216 435
sleep 200
button press left
button release left
sleep 800
screenshot
